  [1 January to 26 January 1930, covering 300 miles with 100 ashramites],
  [8 August to 31 August 1930, covering 200 miles with 72 ashramites],
))
#solution(7, [Parameters of the Dandi March:
- Gandhi started from Sabarmati Ashram on *12 March 1930* with *78 ashramites*.
